
            	<h3><u>VEERAN HAVELI MAIN</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p><u>VEERAN HAVELI MAIN</u></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>VEERAN HAVELI MAIN SUGHRA GHABRATI HAI<br />
AB LAUT KE AA AKBAR, BEEMAR BULATI HAI<br />
<br />
PARDES GAYE AAISE SUGHRA KI NA YAAD AAYI<br />
NANA KAI ROZE PE, FARYAD SUNAATI HAI<br />
<br />
QADMON KE NISHAANO KO KABHI DEKH KAI ROTI HAI&nbsp;<br />
ASGHAR KA KABHI JHOOLA&nbsp; BEEMAR JHULAATI HAI<br />
<br />
AB IN DEEVARON MAIN DAMM GHUTTA HAI SUGHRA KA&nbsp;<br />
LE KE NAAM AKBAR KA, WO ASHK BAHAATI HAI<br />
<br />
AKBAR KI SHAADI KA LAYENGE PAYAAM CHACHA&nbsp;<br />
IS BAAT PE DO SEHRA, BHAI KE BANAATI HAI<br />
<br />
ULJAA HUA BARCHI ME AKBAR KA JIGAR DEKH&nbsp;<br />
IS KHAAB KI SUGHRA KO, TABEER RULAATI HAI</p>

